 dandy  selection tool here  in order to choose for your cleanup type  we have only just begun but we already  have several products for you to try  these products will be available very  soon in just a couple weeks so  i really hope you get a chance to check  them out  thank you again i hope you enjoyed this  presentation  and i look forward to your questions  okay awesome job uh well we are all set  pretty much from here i'll just do some  quick editing on the  front and back end since there is no  interruptions during your presentation  and then we'll have it ready for the  event next week  okay thank you so much of course any  questions for me before we wrap  up nope that was it thank you  awesome have a good rest of your day  bye-bye thanks bye

